    Looking at the requirements:

    **DDMS-GRP-050**: "_When_ viewing a group, the DDMS _shall_ provide a real-time monitoring dashboard showing all devices in the group."

    **DDMS-GRP-051**: "_When_ viewing a group, the DDMS _shall_ provide historical trend charts for devices in that group."

    Both requirements are **already fulfilled** by our implementation:
    - **GRP-050**: Dashboard has group tabs → click tab = "view group" → see real-time monitoring of group devices ✓
    - **GRP-051**: History has group tabs → click tab = "view group" → see historical charts of group devices ✓

    The requirements use "_When_ viewing a group" which doesn't mandate a specific UI pattern (tabs vs separate pages). Our tab-based implementation satisfies the requirement's intent.

    **No changes needed to requirements.md.** The existing requirements are flexible enough to cover our tab-based implementation.

